  "Ice in the Vessel": {
   "rule": "Jade Vessel of the Ice Heart: while you are Composed, your stance ward regains 2 % of its peak each second (never past it). Out of fights, heart-demon odds at a breakthrough fall by a third while the Vessel is worn (the Vessel's tam_ma_resist_pct 33 line, review R3).",
